# 成对草稿: DRAFT-cpp-taskflow-3.8.0-header-only-cmake-recipe.md / .kv
#====================================================================

# ═══ Layer 0: 错误面 (Error Surface) ═══
id:                     DRAFT-cpp-taskflow-3.8.0-header-only-cmake-recipe
trigger_tool:           conan|cmake
phase:                  packaging|testing
error_signature:        TF_BUILD_TESTS|TF_BUILD_EXAMPLES|conan create.*builds tests|find_package\(Taskflow|package_type.*header-library

# ═══ Layer 1: 识别层 (Recognition) ═══
severity:               2
category:               cmake, conan, packaging, headers
match_keywords:         header-only, INTERFACE target, package_type, header-library, self.info.clear, cmake install export, TaskflowConfig.cmake, TF_BUILD_TESTS, find_package CONFIG, CMakeDeps
title:                  header-only CMake INTERFACE 库的 Conan 配方模式（关闭上游默认 tests/examples + 消费上游 CONFIG target）

# ═══ Layer 2: 诊断层 (Diagnosis) ═══
root_cause:             header-only 库（add_library(X INTERFACE)）在上游 CMake 自带完整 install/export（XConfig.cmake + X::X target）时，若 conanfile.py 直接 conan create，上游默认 ON 的 TF_BUILD_TESTS/TF_BUILD_EXAMPLES 会把 26+ unittests/examples 连带构建，引入 3rd-party 测试依赖并大幅拖慢配包装插；同时配方若不声明 package_type=header-library + self.info.clear()，会错误生成与编译器相关的 package_id 并产出空 .so 链接目标。
affected_scope:         header-only C++17/20 CMake INTERFACE target 库（上游自带完整 install/export，如 cpp-taskflow、其他 header-only 任务图/模板库），在 OHOS aarch64 + Conan 2 配包装插场景。
verification_cmd:       conan create archives/c/cpp-taskflow/3.8.0 -pr:h=ci/conan/profiles/ohos-aarch64 -pr:b=ci/conan/profiles/ohos-aarch64 --build=missing

# ═══ Layer 3: 方案层 (Solution Space) ★ ═══
rec_priority:           1
rec_approach:           header-only-cmake-interface-recipe
rec_description:        配方声明 package_type="header-library"，package_id() 里 self.info.clear()（header-only 与编译器/arch 无关）；generate() 用 CMakeToolchain 显式关闭上游默认构建选项（TF_BUILD_TESTS=OFF / TF_BUILD_EXAMPLES=OFF / TF_BUILD_BENCHMARKS=OFF / TF_BUILD_PROFILER=OFF / TF_BUILD_CUDA=OFF / TF_BUILD_SYCL=OFF）；build()/package() 走上游 CMake install（自动装 include + XConfig.cmake）；package_info() 设置 cmake_file_name/cmake_target_name 以便 find_package(CONFIG)；test_package 用 find_package(Taskflow CONFIG REQUIRED) + 链接 Taskflow::Taskflow + 真实调用 API（非空壳）。
rec_command:            python3 scripts/ohc-run.py conan create archives/c/cpp-taskflow/3.8.0 -pr:h=ci/conan/profiles/ohos-aarch64 -pr:b=ci/conan/profiles/ohos-aarch64 --build=missing
rec_auto_fix:           false
rec_impl:               conan-recipe-pattern

fallback_priority:      2
fallback_approach:      header-only-copy-headers
fallback_description:   若上游无完整 install/export，则 package() 直接 copy taskflow/ 头目录到 include/，package_info 只设 includedirs，不提供 CMake CONFIG（消费者用 include path）。
fallback_command:       conan create archives/c/cpp-taskflow/3.8.0 -pr:h=ci/conan/profiles/ohos-aarch64 -pr:b=ci/conan/profiles/ohos-aarch64 --build=missing
fallback_auto_fix:      false
fallback_impl:

forbid_1_pattern:       package_type.*library.*with.*shared.*True|default_options.*shared.*True
forbid_1_reason:        header-only INTERFACE 库无二进制，声明 shared/静态会产生空链接目标与歧义 package_id。
forbid_1_consequence:   conan 生成空 lib 目标，消费者链接失败或产生非确定 package_id。
forbid_2_pattern:       print.*success|skip.*test_package|no.*API.*call
forbid_2_reason:        test_package 必须真实消费被测头 API（R34），禁止空壳。
forbid_2_consequence:   CI L1e 破坏性反向验证失败。
forbid_3_pattern:       TF_BUILD_TESTS.*ON|TF_BUILD_EXAMPLES.*ON
forbid_3_reason:        上游默认开启测试/示例，配包装插必须显式关闭，否则连带构建大量 unittests 并拉入 3rd-party 测试依赖。
forbid_3_consequence:   conan create 极慢或失败，配包装插不稳定。

# ═══ Layer 4: 原则层 (Principles) ═══
principles:             P012, P014

